      "title": "Stop sibling result polling when an async group fails",
      "user": {
        "login": "Kuang-xianxin",
        "id": 243476082,
        "node_id": "U_kgDODoMmcg",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/243476082?v=4",
        "gravatar_id": "",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kuang-xianxin",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/Kuang-xianxin",
        "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kuang-xianxin/followers",
        "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kuang-xianxin/following{/other_user}",
        "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kuang-xianxin/gists{/gist_id}",
        "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kuang-xianxin/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
        "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kuang-xianxin/subscriptions",
        "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kuang-xianxin/orgs",
        "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kuang-xianxin/repos",
        "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kuang-xianxin/events{/privacy}",
        "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kuang-xianxin/received_events",
        "type": "User",
        "user_view_type": "public",
        "site_admin": false
      },
      "body": "When one result in `aget_result_group()` raises, `asyncio.gather()` leaves the other result pollers running. A missing result can then be polled indefinitely after the caller has already received the error.\n\nKeep references to the result-wait tasks and cancel and await any unfinished ones before returning or propagating an exception. This stops only local result polling; queued Huey tasks are not revoked. Tests cover failure cleanup, continued execution of the queued task, caller cancellation, and existing successful group results.\n\nValidation:\n- The failure-cleanup regression fails on unchanged `dbd1aef`; the other five asyncio tests pass there.\n- Python 3.13.14: 135 asyncio/API/wrapper/immediate-mode tests pass. Python 3.10.20: all six asyncio helper tests pass.\n- `git diff --check` passes. The full backend/consumer test suite was not run.\n",
      "created_at": "2026-09-13T05:28:56Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-13T05:28:56Z",
